# ── Subdomain folders ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# writing/ and portrait/ are published as their own Netlify sites from this
# same repo, but the folders also sit inside this site's root deploy.
#
# This site is the portfolio — for creative directors and hiring. Writing and
# the portrait offer deliberately do not exist as paths here, so these return
# a hard 404 rather than forwarding to the subdomains.
#
# The ! is mandatory: the static files exist at these paths and would shadow
# an unforced rule.

/writing           /404.html   404!
/writing/*         /404.html   404!

/portrait          /404.html   404!
/portrait/*        /404.html   404!
